WEBVTT

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:30.920
I believed what Kendrick Lamar
says on "Section.80.":

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.936
"I'm not on the outside looking in.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.896
I'm not on the inside looking out.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.336
I'm in the dead fucking center
looking around."

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.816
(Laughter)

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.816
That was the place

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.016
from which I hoped to work,

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:48.496
headed in the only direction worth going,
the direction of myself,

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.376
trying to help us all
refuse the awful bargains

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:53.680
we've been taught to take.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.856
We're taught to turn ourselves

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:00.936
and our work into little nuggets
that are easily digestible;